# Astro/Vite environment for browser-safe configuration only.
# Values with PUBLIC_ may be bundled into client assets. Never put secrets here.
# This starter currently reads runtime/server configuration from apps/web/.dev.vars.
# Add project-specific public variables here only when the UI actually consumes them.

# Example public values (rename/remove or wire them into the app as needed):
PUBLIC_APP_NAME=Your project name
PUBLIC_APP_URL=http://localhost:4321
